	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010030b"},
		line=1331,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After our morning training, Hotori and I visit the Imperial\nTemple's office.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We're here, of course, to ask the Exalt-Priestess to Hone our spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry. Her Eminence is very busy at the moment.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When might we be able to see her?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“I am unfortunately not at liberty to say, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then can you tell her that a man named Tokita came to see her? I'll be back here tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“Very well, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like being the Exalt-Priestess does a number on your schedule.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We really need her to Hone those blades, though.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Hotori crosses her arms.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We might never get to see her at this rate.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“After all, she's the personage who stands at the very top of the hieratic order.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She didn't seem like a bad person based on my conversation with her yesterday. I'm sure she'll grant us an audience.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You know, Soujin, you put too much faith in people sometimes.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Faith is just a matter of opinion, after all. Is that so strange?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Hotori looks me in the eye.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're strong, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Meanwhile, I'm constantly second-guessing myself.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you so unsure about?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whether I'm fit to be the head of House Inou, whether I'm doing a good job as acting chairman...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Seriously, there's no end to it.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori can often be too harsh on herself.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"From my point of view, she's working plenty hard enough, but she still seems to think she has a long way to go.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Her responsibilities as the head of House Inou and her memories of the war are constantly spurring her forward.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're doing a great job as acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On top of that, you're doing great as a singer as well.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I couldn't even do half the things you're doing.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, I shouldn't be whining.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Hotori claps her cheeks and hardens her expression.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only I were more of a gentleman, I would've been able to come up with better words to cheer you up with.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just always stay the way you are. It's more than enough for me.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Hotori says with a natural smile.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, here. Today's breakfast.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Just like always, I accept the breakfast she went out of her way to make for me.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The immense debt I owe her makes it feel heavier than it should.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She's been supporting me like this ever since the war.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Perhaps I should stop having her go to so much trouble for my sake.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, Hotori─”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't finish that sentence.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As long as you chose your own path by following your own fealty, I'll be on your side.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even if we have to fight, even if I have to strike you down myself, I'll always be on your side.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“After all, I...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"She bites her lip before finishing her sentence.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine. Please just let me keep doing what I've always done.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Alright.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"In the face of Hotori's innocent, too-pure feelings, that is all I manage to say.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, I'll see you at school then.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"With her blade in hand, she runs off.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"The food I'm carrying somehow feels a little heavier with each step I take.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Lunchtime.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Akari, Hotori, Shino, and I sit together. As we eat our meal, the student council president approaches our table.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Salutations.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Salutations.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"The president gives us a perfunctory greeting.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"After the events of yesterday, I have to be on my guard.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've been keeping an eye on you the past few days, Miyaguni-san. But it seems like you aren't heeding my warning.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I believe I kindly recommended against fraternizing with the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for the warning, but I'll be friends with whoever I want.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The two face each other with picture-perfect smiles on their faces.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I think quite highly of you, I'll have you know. Your remarks in class the other day were outstanding.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you'd like, what say you to joining the council this coming spring?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say what?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Even Akari didn't see that one coming.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this all of a sudden? What do you mean, 'join the\ncouncil?'”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, the student council, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I would like you to be my vice president. I've been having a hard time ever since the last one transferred away.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I recommend against it.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yes, I appreciate the offer, but I'm afraid I'll have to decline.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd like to hear your opinion if you please, not just\nTokita-kun's.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mine's the same as his.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And besides, if I ever do decide to join, I'd want to be the president.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Hearing this, even the disinterested Hotori perks up.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, you got some balls, girl.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahahaha, you lose this round, Elsa. Hahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino, you're laughing too hard.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"The president lets out a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well. I won't give out any more unwelcome advice.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad you understand.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Really, I never knew the Empire had people who speak as frankly as you do.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Way too many Imperials hold back from saying what's on their minds.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well I, for one, much prefer to enjoy my lunch with some peace and quiet.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well. My apologies for interrupting your meal.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The president receives Akari's barbed words with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"As you might expect, she has enough composure to not react to a provocation like this.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll leave you to it. I bid you good day.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"She says her farewell with a smile and leaves our table.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"We all breathe a small sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa & Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!” “Waaah!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I turn in the direction where the small scream came from and immediately doubt my own eyes.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No way...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm? Wait, isn't that...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess, in the flesh.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Seeing as she's wearing our school uniform, it doesn't appear as though she's merely paying a temporary visit.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Say, you should really watch where you're going.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawa! I'm terribly sorry, I'm terribly sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Err-Whaaaaat? A Republican?!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“≪H-How are you? How are you? Ready? All ready?≫”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, now I remember. She's the new Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I sent her a congratulatory gift basket just the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Shino looks satisfied after clearing up her own confusion.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Doesn't look like she intends to actually help.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyways, would you mind moving aside?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But I got your uniform all dirty!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"The priestess takes out her handkerchief and pats down the president's clothes.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah, hey, where do you think you're touching?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry, I'm terribly sorry, I'm terribly sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heh! Hehehee, th-that tickles!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Look here... Stop it! Cut it out! Ahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The person in charge of maintaining all of Tenkyo's public order is squirming about with uncontrollable laughter.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Republican onlookers start forming a crowd around them.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Umm, think we should go help her?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Probably, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Akari and I stand and head towards the scene of the ruckus.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ko-to-ne! Calm down!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The priestess freezes in place.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah, haah, haah... I see you've finally calmed yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I am truly sorry, I...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The two put some distance between them.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Uh, um, I am most terribly sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I just transferred in, so I could not help my gaze from wandering...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaah!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"The priestess shrinks into herself.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're the Exalt-Priestess...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, indeed. My name is Shiinoha Kotone. I am humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Whatever might the Exalt-Priestess be doing in a place like this?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There are various circumstances involved...”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Kotone equivocates while awkwardly scratching her head.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“By the way, ma'am, whomever might you be?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm the student council president, Elsa Valentine.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, is it? I am most pleased to make your acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Kotone gives her a sincere smile.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Have you... not heard of me?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“N-No. I am afraid I have not.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, I see...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The president relaxes, evidently realizing the priestess genuinely meant no harm.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, Shiinoha-san, I bid you a pleasant school life.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"The president turns and addresses the surrounding crowd.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I apologize for disturbing your meal, everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The problem has been resolved now, so please return to your seats.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"At the president's words, the onlookers disperse.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Eminence, why don't you catch your breath over here?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I lead the priestess to a vacant seat at our table.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"After we finish a round of introductions, I give the priestess the run-down of the academy.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? D-Do you mean to say I just spilled strawberry milk on the governor-general's own daughter?!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got some serious guts, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-It's all over for me... Ah, Oomikami... please grant me Thy protection...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"She trembles, her face white as a sheet.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, why is the Exalt-Priestess of all people attending school?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Lord Chancellor Okonogi proclaimed that from now on, the Exalt-Priestess ought to learn more about the populace.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Therefore, I am to attend school in between my duties.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, isn't that suspicious.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"The three of us mutter, tilting our heads.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'think maybe he wants her slacking on the job?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As in, cutting back on her duties and training to weaken her magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, this cafeteria is certainly amazing, and there were indeed many tasty-looking shops on the way here... I fear I may indeed be in grave peril.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, Your Eminence's piety would lose out to your hunger?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-Why, I never! I pray every day, I'll have you know. Every single day!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"She lightly strikes me with alternating left and right jabs.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Without Your Eminence, the warriors would be in big trouble. Please do continue to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If that is how you are playing, then what of you warriors? Are you two keeping up your training with the blade?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The priestess playfully looks at me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" been negligent in our training.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I'm terribly sorry. I got carried away. Please find it within your mercy to forgive me...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, I wasn't─”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahhh, awawawawa...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Kotone trembles uncontrollably.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Hotori is wearing a surly expression, but on the inside,\nshe's probably desperately trying to think of a way to smooth things over.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Kotone definitely has her pegged as an intimidating warrior.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Well, not like that's anything new.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, it's almost time for class.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"With Akari's voice as our signal, we all stand up.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Eminence, I have a matter I wish to discuss with you. Might you have time after school today?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, absolutely, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, if it pleases you, might you call me 'Kotone' rather than 'Your Eminence?'”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To call the Exalt-Priestess by her name would be the height of insolence...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not mind at all. People have always just called me Kotone, so being called anything else feels strange.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that's the case, I shall meet your request.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well then, Kotone, I'll catch you after school.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, by all means!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Kotone shows me a carefree smile in response.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Just as she said, being called by her name seems to suit her much more.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"After school, I head to the meeting spot we had arranged only to find Kotone already waiting there.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Her hair flutters about each time she scans her surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't you think a hairstyle like that'd get in the way during a fight?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's symmetrical, so it's probably pretty stable.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmmm... That's a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That somehow made sense to you?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, hello, everyone!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Kotone trots over to us while waving.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Did you happen to see the bulletin board? This is big news! The news of the century!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Has anyone ever told you you're awfully overactive?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, almost every day when I was in Iseya, in fact...”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah! Never mind that. We've got big news!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Kotone points at the school bulletin board.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"It reads, “Enhanced Security Measures for Empress Hisui's Day at School.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She will be attending this very academy!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"The set date is next Tuesday; talk about short notice.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is this not big news indeed!?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Kotone puffs out her chest as though it was her own doing.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"It's certainly big news, but I can't imagine what must be involved for the security personnel.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, what're you looking at me for?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I could've sworn I saw malice in those eyes...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're imagining things.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look me in the eyes and say that again.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehee, you have become much more cheerful since you arrived in Tenkyo, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Oh, yeah. Maybe I have.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Akari awkwardly looks away.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's talk on the way.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"With my encouragement, the four of us leave campus.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Never did I imagine I might have the chance to meet Empress Hisui again...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've had an audience with her before?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, very recently. She had very kind words for me at my ordination as Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her Majesty is truly the very image of a benevolent and noble ruler of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh-huh...”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Akari mutters, her eyes completely glazed over.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“By the by, Tokita-sama, I believe you had some matter to discuss with me?”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, about that.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The truth is, I wanted to ask you to Hone some blades.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though the blades in question are somewhat special... I trust you understand what I'm getting at?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, but of course, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Before we proceed further, I should warn you that what\nwe're talking about is currently illegal in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's possible the authorities could come after you.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Kotone's expression hardens.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-Once I Hone them, whatever might they be used for?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Think we're just gonna pick our teeth with them?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“C-Certainly not. Perish the thought.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Kotone answers with a tremble.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"After what happened at lunch, she's clearly afraid of Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior cuts down none but his lord's foes.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Kotone falls silent.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"This is surely a difficult decision for an ingenuous girl like her.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was just considering how I might repay you for your benevolence last night.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I humbly accept your request.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Kotone crosses her fingers in front of her and bows deeply.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If the Republic comes after you, you can just tell them the warriors threatened you.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perish the thought.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Honing blades is the rite of the priestesses. I would never imagine selling out my allies.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, do not worry about me. I am at your humble service.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Kotone's words send a shiver through my chest.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"At the sight of her dainty figure, there was surely a part of me deep down that doubted her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"But my worries were completely unfounded.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"She was truly the right person to entrust our spellblades with.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When shall I perform the Honing?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The sooner, the better. What time is convenient for you?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My duties end by ten of the clock in the evening, so any time after that would be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, does tonight work?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Hotori responds with a simple nod.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-Inou-sama, um...”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, um, you see...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you know how it is that we Hone a blade?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We take it and sort of... sorta... ≪sword-a...≫”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui would have laughed at thaaaaat!”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Kotone scampers away at lightning speed.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How was that my fault?!”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should've laughed, too! Kotone reached real deep to come up with that one!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"While Akari continues to berate me, Hotori looks as surly as ever.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What does ≪sword≫ mean?”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You think I know?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...You two are hopeless.”",
			},
		},
	},
